[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     92[0m:[38;5;10m[49m exploratory sweep, not in either program, and it is recorded because it produced
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     93[0m:[38;5;10m[49m false passes:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     94[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
